{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03463","headline":"忽梦游仙 · 王勃","name":"忽梦游仙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仆本江上客，牵迹在方内。\n寤寐霄汉间，居然有灵对。\n翕尔登霞首，依然蹑云背。\n电策驱龙光，烟途俨鸾态。\n乘月披金帔，连星解琼佩。\n浮识俄易归，真游邈难再。\n寥廓沈遐想，周遑奉遗诲。\n流俗非我乡，何当释尘昧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王勃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03463.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03463","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}